 cycle. The daily cycle has already failed (broke its own start low).", "next": "Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, tight stop below 4.46. Not an investment buy; wait for the weekly timeframe to actually turn up (or a fresh investor-cycle low to confirm) before trusting it.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low)", "regime_score": -4.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low) (investor cycle week 23 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 34d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): counter-trend bounce. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (34d ago)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average", "Daily momentum ~1 bars from turning up"], "entry": {"tag": "BOUNCE \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u53cd\u5f39 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "Counter-trend bounce inside a bearish bigger picture. For nimble traders only \u2014 small size, tight stop below 4.46. If the daily low fails it cascades toward the larger cycle low; not an investment buy.", "text_zh": "\u5904\u4e8e\u770b\u7a7a\u5927\u5c40\u4e2d\u7684\u9006\u52bf\u53cd\u5f39\u3002\u4ec5\u9650\u7075\u6d3b\u4ea4\u6613\u8005\u2014\u2014\u5c0f\u4ed3\u4f4d\u3001\u5c06\u6b62\u635f\u7d27\u8d34 4.46 \u4e0b\u65b9\u3002\u82e5\u65e5\u7ebf\u4f4e\u70b9\u5931\u5b88\uff0c\u5c06\u5411\u66f4\u5927\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u8513\u5ef6\uff1b\u5e76\u975e\u6295\u8d44\u6027\u4e70\u5165\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 68 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2